  "system": {
    "slug": "rampart-mech",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 5
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Rampart Mechs are an upgraded Cerberus combat robot introduced during the occupation of Omega. They are significantly more durable than LOKI Mechs, equipped with a powerful kinetic shield system and a submachine gun. Their most dangerous feature is the ability to temporarily activate a powerful barrier pulse that damages and Staggers nearby enemies.</p><p><strong>Construct Immunities:</strong> Immune to disease, mental effects, poison, sleep, and paralysis.</p><p><strong>Barrier Pulse (2 actions):</strong> The Rampart Mech discharges its shield energy in a 15-foot burst. Each creature in the area takes 3d6 bludgeoning damage (DC 22 Reflex for half). The Mech's kinetic shield is reduced to 0 after use and must recharge before it can pulse again.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Shield:</strong> 50 Shield HP. Recharges 15 HP per turn.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
        "authors": "nscarpinatodev",
